"""
SPACE GAME v4  -  made by Claude A.I and ZEE

HOW TO RUN: open this file in IDLE and press F5.
Nothing to install (it only uses tkinter, which comes with Python).

CONTROLS
  Left / Right arrows (or A / D) = move your spaceship
  SPACE (hold it)                = fire the blue cannons
  F = switch between 30 and 60 FPS (use 30 if your laptop is slow)
  P = pause      M = sound on/off      R = restart after Game Over / Win

HOW IT WORKS
  - Every level: kill the circle-ship minions, then a BIG BOSS arrives.
  - Bosses also call in more minions while you fight them!
  - Kill the boss = level cleared + a REWARD (faster cannons, +1 heart,
    and an extra cannon every 5 levels).
  - HARDCORE: you have 10 hearts. When they are gone, the game is over.
  - Level 20 is the FINAL BOSS. Beat it and you win!

WHAT'S NEW IN v4
  - Much lighter on slow laptops: the background is one picture, bullets and
    sparks are re-used instead of re-drawn, and sound plays in its own thread.
  - FPS switch: 30 or 60 (press F any time). The game speed stays the same.
  - Minecraft-hardcore-style pixel hearts (half hearts, white blink on damage).
  - The game no longer closes on a bug: it prints the error and goes back to
    the title screen.

OPTIONAL BACKGROUND PICTURE
  Save a space picture next to this file and name it  background.png
  (PNG or GIF, about 600 x 700). If it is not there, the game makes its own
  purple galaxy.
"""

